            <h2>Deploy a Container</h2>
            <div class="cmd">curl -X POST http://localhost:4000/container \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"image":"nginx","tag":"alpine","containerName":"web-demo"}'<button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>

            <h3>Request Body Schema</h3>
            <table>
                <thead><tr><th>Field</th><th>Type</th><th>Required</th><th>Description</th></tr></thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr><td><code>image</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class="badge green">required</span></td><td>Docker Hub image name</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>tag</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class="badge amber">optional</span></td><td>Image tag. Defaults to <code>latest</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>containerName</code></td><td>string</td><td><span class="badge amber">optional</span></td><td>Unique container name for subdomain routing</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>env</code></td><td>string[]</td><td><span class="badge amber">optional</span></td><td>Environment variables e.g. <code>["PORT=3000"]</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>ports</code></td><td>object[]</td><td><span class="badge amber">optional</span></td><td>Port mappings <code>[{hostPort:"8080",containerPort:"80"}]</code></td></tr>
                    <tr><td><code>autoRemove</code></td><td>boolean</td><td><span class="badge amber">optional</span></td><td>Auto-delete on stop. Default <code>false</code></td></tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <h2>List All Containers</h2>
            <div class="cmd">curl http://localhost:4000/container<button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>

            <h2>Inspect Container</h2>
            <div class="cmd">curl http://localhost:4000/container/web-demo<button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>

            <h2>Power Actions</h2>
            <p>All power actions follow the pattern <code>POST /container/:id/:action</code></p>

            <div class="cmd">curl -X POST http://localhost:4000/container/web-demo/start<button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>
            <div class="cmd">curl -X POST http://localhost:4000/container/web-demo/stop<button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>
            <div class="cmd">curl -X POST http://localhost:4000/container/web-demo/pause<button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>
            <div class="cmd">curl -X POST http://localhost:4000/container/web-demo/unpause<button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>

            <h2>Delete Container</h2>
            <div class="cmd">curl -X DELETE "http://localhost:4000/container/web-demo?force=true"<button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>

